window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Trapped by a curse. Hunted by darkness.</p> <p>Kirsten Hart has lived her entire life bound by a curse, a wolf trapped within her, unable to shift and powerless to escape. But when a hidden betrayal shatters everything she believed, she uncovers the true cost of breaking the curse — a price far more terrifying than she ever imagined.</p> <p>Lucian Vale, a powerful vampire lord, is consumed by his hunger for control. His obsession with Kirsten threatens to unravel the carefully crafted world he's fought to dominate. While his desire to rule the pack fuels him, his growing feelings for her pull him into uncharted, dangerous territory.</p> <p>Nolan Attwood was just a teenager when his pack was slaughtered, his life forever altered by the brutal death of his pack — especially the Alpha, his father. Marked as the new Alpha, Nolan fled into hiding, alone for ten years. Now, fate has led him back to Kirsten. Their bond is undeniable — they are fated mates, but the consequences of their connection are far from simple.</p> <p>Years before the Thundermoon Pack was massacred, the Moonbound Pack and Thundermoon Pack made a desperate blood pact with the deities, binding Nolan and Kirsten to break the curse. But the deities have never accepted their offering — and they have a different price in mind.</p> <p>Kirsten and Nolan are torn. They both know the cost of breaking the curse — and neither is willing to give what it will take. The weight of their fates presses down on them. Will they find a way to escape the pact — or will the deities come to collect, no matter the cost?</p>"; 
